# MASTER PROJECT DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# PITCHARENA – AI-POWERED STARTUP INNOVATION & EVALUATION PLATFORM

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, UI/UX designer, database engineer, cybersecurity specialist, and AI application developer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, responsive, production-oriented web application named **PitchArena**.

Do not build just a landing page or a static dashboard prototype. Build a fully functional application with frontend, backend, MySQL database, authentication, APIs, role-based permissions, data management, and working interactions.

The application should be structured so that it can eventually be extended into a React Native mobile application.

---

# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project Name: PitchArena

Tagline: Your Idea. Your Pitch. Your Arena.

Project Description:

PitchArena is an AI-powered, gamified startup innovation and evaluation platform that connects student founders, startup teams, industry experts, investors, mentors, and administrators.

The platform allows students and founders to submit startup ideas, participate in innovation challenges, create startup profiles, receive AI-powered suggestions, and track their startup journey.

Professional reviewers and judges evaluate submitted startups using a transparent, structured scoring system.

Administrators manage users, startup submissions, challenges, judge assignments, evaluations, competitions, results, rewards, and platform analytics.

PitchArena should combine the concept of a startup accelerator, Shark Tank-style pitch competition, innovation challenge platform, and startup development ecosystem.

The application should initially support three distinct user interfaces:

1. Founder / Student Interface
2. Reviewer / Judge Interface
3. Administrator Interface

All three interfaces must communicate through a common backend and MySQL database.

