# 11. EVALUATION ENGINE

Create a configurable weighted evaluation engine.

Default criteria:

Innovation: 20%
Problem relevance: 15%
Technical feasibility: 20%
Market potential: 15%
Scalability: 15%
Team capability: 10%
Presentation quality: 5%

Total: 100%.

Judges score each criterion out of 10.

Calculate final score on the backend.

Allow multiple judges to independently evaluate the same startup.

Calculate:
- Individual judge score.
- Average application score.
- Score variation.
- Evaluation completion percentage.

Suggested configurable thresholds:

85–100: Strong shortlist recommendation.

70–84: Further consideration.

Below 70: Not recommended.

These thresholds are recommendations only. Admin should be able to configure the official selection rules.

Never automatically convert a score into an official result without the configured approval workflow.

